This namespace allows you to generate and install POSIX man pages for all scw commands.

USAGE:
  scw man <command>

UTILITY COMMANDS:
  install     Install the man pages of all scw commands in a given directory

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for man
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta             Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use

Use "scw man [command] --help" for more information about a command.
